    "Two opposite-order isolated repetitions per target and arm. Source-prefix reconstruction, discovery preparation, indexing, checking, propagation, serialization/reload and semantic cold verification are charged. Startup/loading, historical acquisition, final audit and diagnostic open closures are additional.",
