    "Isolated archives may duplicate content. Open states retain old layers and complete B6 closures; old B5 history cannot skip changed B6 candidates. Cumulative tables and production defaults are unchanged.",
    "Finite sampled coverage and cheaper positive certificates do not bound unrestricted SAT, future proof layers, distinct contexts or lifetime memory."
